@PulseApi = http://localhost:5044

### Create a PurchaseOrder
POST {{PulseApi}}/api/purchaseorders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": 123,
  "items": [
    { "sku": "ABC-1", "quantity": 10 },
    { "sku": "XYZ-2", "quantity": 5 }
  ]
}

### Get created PurchaseOrder
# Replace 1 with the returned id
GET {{PulseApi}}/api/purchaseorders/1
Accept: application/json
